flowchart TD
    A[***Input Data***:<br/>Human Scores & LLM Scores] --> B[***Step 1***:<br/>Compute Inter-Human<br/>Disagreement<br/>Pairwise absolute differences]
    A --> C[***Step 2***:<br/>Compute<br/>Human-LLM Disagreement<br/>Absolute differences]
    A --> D[***Step 4***:<br/>Establish<br/>Random Baseline<br/>Uniform random scores]
    
    B --> E[Distribution of<br/>Human-Human Disagreements]
    C --> F[Distribution of<br/>Human-LLM Disagreements]
    D --> G[Distribution of<br/>Random-Human Disagreements]
    
    E --> H[***Step 3***:<br/>Statistical Comparison<br/>Mann-Whitney U Test]
    F --> H
    G --> H
    
    H --> I{***Is p-value ≥ 0.05?***}
    I -->|***Yes***| J[LLM is ***'Good Enough'***<br/>Within human variability]
    I -->|***No***| K[LLM is **NOT** ***'Good Enough'***<br/>Significantly diverges<br/>from humans]
    
    style J fill:#90EE90
    style K fill:#FFB6C1
    style H fill:#87CEEB